#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/index.rst:4
msgid "MaxFrame LiteFrame"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page gives an overview of all public MaxFrame LiteFrame objects, "
"functions and methods. All classes and functions exposed in "
"``maxframe.liteframe.*`` namespace are public."
msgstr ""
"本页面概述了所有公共的 MaxFrame LiteFrame 对象、函数和方法。在 ``maxframe"
".liteframe.*`` 命名空间中公开的所有类和函数都是公共的。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"LiteFrame is a performance-dedicated tabular data type in MaxFrame with *"
"*no index semantics**, designed for simplified column-based operations "
"with Arrow dtypes as first-class citizens. It provides a pandas-looking "
"DataFrame API that eliminates the complexity of index management — no "
"implicit label alignment, no unexpected frame stacking during aggregation"
", and no silent type promotion when integer columns contain nulls. By "
"removing index overhead and embedding element-wise expressions in a small"
" set of fusible operators, LiteFrame achieves lower planning cost and "
"higher execution throughput."
msgstr ""
"LiteFrame 是 MaxFrame 中专为性能设计的表格数据类型，具有**无索引语义**的"
"特点，专为简化的基于列的操作而设计，将 Arrow 数据类型作为一等公民。它提供"
"了一个类似 pandas 的 DataFrame API，消除了索引管理的复杂性——没有隐式标签"
"对齐，在聚合期间没有意外的框架堆叠，当整数列包含空值时也没有静默的类型"
"提升。通过移除索引开销并将元素级表达式嵌入到一组可融合操作符中，LiteFrame"
" 实现了更低的规划成本和更高的执行吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"LiteFrame is **not** a replacement for the existing MaxFrame DataFrame. "
"It serves a complementary role: a simpler, index-free substrate for "
"workflows that do not need full pandas Index behavior. Both LiteFrame and"
" DataFrame coexist in MaxFrame — choose LiteFrame for straightforward "
"column-oriented data processing, or use DataFrame when you need index-"
"aware operations."
msgstr ""
"LiteFrame **不是**现有 MaxFrame DataFrame 的替代品。它起着互补的作用："
"对于不需要完整 pandas 索引行为的工作流程，提供一个更简单、无索引的基础。"
"LiteFrame 和 DataFrame 在 MaxFrame 中共存——选择 LiteFrame 进行直接的面向"
"列的数据处理，或者在需要索引感知操作时使用 DataFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"All operations are lazy: they return LiteFrame objects that are executed "
"on demand via ``.execute()``. Row order is preserved through execution "
"unless an operator explicitly reorders rows, enabling positional APIs "
"like ``iloc``, ``head``, ``shift``, and cumulative operations."
msgstr ""
"所有操作都是惰性的：它们返回通过 ``.execute()`` 按需执行的 LiteFrame 对象"
"。行顺序在执行过程中得以保留，除非操作符明确重新排序行，这使得位置 API 如"
" ``iloc``、``head``、``shift`` 和累积操作成为可能。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"The LiteFrame API is currently in beta. While functional, it may evolve "
"in future releases — method names, parameters, and behavior may change "
"based on feedback and further development."
msgstr "LiteFrame API 目前处于 beta 阶段。虽然功能可用，但后续版本中可能会演进——方法名、参数和行为可能会根据反馈和后续开发进行调整。"

